    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "Type King is a typing and jumping game. With three different game modes all of which have three difficulty levels there is plenty to play here! The land is split into fifteen states all of which are led by corrupt governors from their high towers. It is up to you to rid the land of corruption by overruling the leaders of those states. Only then can you be crowned the Type King!<br><br><strong>Jumping</strong><br>This might look easy but I assure you it is not. A vital skill for every Type King which makes this game mode a good place to start your journey.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411530/extras/1888b9a52b20d4e2a233d8d8ddbbdc26.poster.avif?t=1715595517\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411530/extras/1888b9a52b20d4e2a233d8d8ddbbdc26.webm?t=1715595517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411530/extras/1888b9a52b20d4e2a233d8d8ddbbdc26.mp4?t=1715595517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Typing</strong><br>Hone your typing skills with this game mode where both speed and accuracy are needed. With the different difficulty levels there is challenge for everyone!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411530/extras/dc1b7dffaa8a8c92b63949242828565f.poster.avif?t=1715595517\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411530/extras/dc1b7dffaa8a8c92b63949242828565f.webm?t=1715595517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411530/extras/dc1b7dffaa8a8c92b63949242828565f.mp4?t=1715595517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Type King</strong><br>Typing and jumping combined makes Type King! There are three varieties of this game mode: Multiplayer co-op where one player is typing and the other is jumping as well as singleplayer variants where you type with one hand and jump with the other.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411530/extras/2b72eb19f2f6f12e25d4f8401c889394.poster.avif?t=1715595517\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411530/extras/2b72eb19f2f6f12e25d4f8401c889394.webm?t=1715595517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411530/extras/2b72eb19f2f6f12e25d4f8401c889394.mp4?t=1715595517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Save progress by unlocking codes</strong><br>In Easy and Normal difficulty the checkpoints between floors include codes which can be used in the menu to continue where you left off. These aren't there to help in Hard difficulty so just keep practising!<br><br><strong>Accessibility</strong><br>Type King is family-friendly and can be enjoyed by people of any age! It also has option for easy to read font.<br><br><strong>Keyboard layouts</strong><br>Supports QWERTY, AZERTY, QWERTZ and DVORAK keyboard layouts<br><br><strong>Comments</strong><br>This is absolutely horrible. This is the hardest game I've ever played!<br>-Developer's eight years old cousin who can't get enough of Type King<br><br>After hours of trying I finally saw the top of the tower in Jumping on Hard difficulty and then I fell and now I'm losing my mind<br>-Developer's friend (could be former friend now)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411530/extras/8bfda27613f0884f1b40c73f923bc202.poster.avif?t=1715595517\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411530/extras/8bfda27613f0884f1b40c73f923bc202.webm?t=1715595517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411530/extras/8bfda27613f0884f1b40c73f923bc202.mp4?t=1715595517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "Type King is a typing and jumping game. With three different game modes all of which have three difficulty levels there is plenty to play here! The land is split into fifteen states all of which are led by corrupt governors from their high towers. It is up to you to rid the land of corruption by overruling the leaders of those states. Only then can you be crowned the Type King!<br><br><strong>Jumping</strong><br>This might look easy but I assure you it is not. A vital skill for every Type King which makes this game mode a good place to start your journey.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411530/extras/1888b9a52b20d4e2a233d8d8ddbbdc26.poster.avif?t=1715595517\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411530/extras/1888b9a52b20d4e2a233d8d8ddbbdc26.webm?t=1715595517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411530/extras/1888b9a52b20d4e2a233d8d8ddbbdc26.mp4?t=1715595517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Typing</strong><br>Hone your typing skills with this game mode where both speed and accuracy are needed. With the different difficulty levels there is challenge for everyone!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411530/extras/dc1b7dffaa8a8c92b63949242828565f.poster.avif?t=1715595517\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411530/extras/dc1b7dffaa8a8c92b63949242828565f.webm?t=1715595517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411530/extras/dc1b7dffaa8a8c92b63949242828565f.mp4?t=1715595517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Type King</strong><br>Typing and jumping combined makes Type King! There are three varieties of this game mode: Multiplayer co-op where one player is typing and the other is jumping as well as singleplayer variants where you type with one hand and jump with the other.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411530/extras/2b72eb19f2f6f12e25d4f8401c889394.poster.avif?t=1715595517\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411530/extras/2b72eb19f2f6f12e25d4f8401c889394.webm?t=1715595517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411530/extras/2b72eb19f2f6f12e25d4f8401c889394.mp4?t=1715595517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Save progress by unlocking codes</strong><br>In Easy and Normal difficulty the checkpoints between floors include codes which can be used in the menu to continue where you left off. These aren't there to help in Hard difficulty so just keep practising!<br><br><strong>Accessibility</strong><br>Type King is family-friendly and can be enjoyed by people of any age! It also has option for easy to read font.<br><br><strong>Keyboard layouts</strong><br>Supports QWERTY, AZERTY, QWERTZ and DVORAK keyboard layouts<br><br><strong>Comments</strong><br>This is absolutely horrible. This is the hardest game I've ever played!<br>-Developer's eight years old cousin who can't get enough of Type King<br><br>After hours of trying I finally saw the top of the tower in Jumping on Hard difficulty and then I fell and now I'm losing my mind<br>-Developer's friend (could be former friend now)<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411530/extras/8bfda27613f0884f1b40c73f923bc202.poster.avif?t=1715595517\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411530/extras/8bfda27613f0884f1b40c73f923bc202.webm?t=1715595517\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2411530/extras/8bfda27613f0884f1b40c73f923bc202.mp4?t=1715595517\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
